{
  "id": "C03",
  "tier": "C",
  "structure": "cast_continuous_with_piers",
  "review_status": "decision-level answers reviewed by two bridge engineers",
  "input": {
    "structured_en": "[Span arrangement] One cast-in-place continuous unit of three spans, 32 + 40 + 32 m (centre-to-centre of bearings); deck width 16 m.\n[Section and material] Cast-in-place prestressed concrete box girder, single-cell box section of constant depth 2 m: top slab 16 m wide and 0.25 m thick; bottom slab 9 m wide and 0.22 m thick; two vertical webs 0.5 m thick; cantilever flanges 0.5 m thick at the root tapering linearly to 0.2 m at the tip; girder concrete C50. The owner requires a unit weight of 26.5 kN/m3 for the girder concrete. Consider the self-weight of the main girders only (no wet joints, diaphragms, pavement or barriers).\n[Bearings and boundary] Abutment 0 and Abutment 3: PTFE sliding laminated elastomeric bearings, two per support line; effective plan size 400 mm x 500 mm, five internal rubber layers 11 mm thick. Pier 1: PTFE sliding laminated elastomeric bearings, two per support line; effective plan size 550 mm x 650 mm, six internal rubber layers 11 mm thick. Pier 2: plain laminated elastomeric bearings (fixed), two per support line; effective plan size 600 mm x 700 mm, seven internal rubber layers 11 mm thick. Piers: twin circular columns of 1.6 m diameter, concrete C40, fixed at the base; height from base to bearings: Pier 1 14 m; Pier 2 6 m.\n[Design standard] Highway Class I loading (JTG D60-2015); one-way traffic, carriageway width 15 m, four design lanes.",
    "structured_zh": "【跨径布置】现浇连续梁一联三跨，跨径 32 + 40 + 32 m（支座中心线间距）；桥面全宽 16 m。\n【截面与材料】现浇预应力混凝土箱梁，单箱单室等高截面，梁高 2 m：顶板宽 16 m、厚 0.25 m；底板宽 9 m、厚 0.22 m；两道竖直腹板厚 0.5 m；翼缘悬臂根部厚 0.5 m，线性变化至端部 0.2 m；主梁混凝土 C50。业主要求主梁混凝土重度取 26.5 kN/m³。只计主梁自重（不计湿接缝、横隔板、铺装与护栏）。\n【支座与边界】0 号台、3 号台：四氟滑板式板式橡胶支座，每条支承线 2 个；有效平面尺寸 400 mm × 500 mm，中间橡胶层 5 层、每层厚 11 mm。1 号墩：四氟滑板式板式橡胶支座，每条支承线 2 个；有效平面尺寸 550 mm × 650 mm，中间橡胶层 6 层、每层厚 11 mm。2 号墩：普通板式橡胶支座（固定），每条支承线 2 个；有效平面尺寸 600 mm × 700 mm，中间橡胶层 7 层、每层厚 11 mm。桥墩：双圆柱墩，柱径 1.6 m，混凝土 C40，墩底固结；墩底至支座高度：1 号墩 14 m；2 号墩 6 m。\n【设计标准】公路-I 级（JTG D60-2015）；单向行驶，行车道宽 15 m，设计车道数 4。"
  },
